flowchart TD
    SRS[API Specification / SRS] --> RE[Requirement Extractor]
    KB[(Reviewed Rules & Prompt Knowledge)] --> RE
    RE --> PA[Parameter & Constraint Analyzer]
    PA --> TP[Test Technique Planner<br/>Equivalence Partitioning · Boundary · State · Security · Schema]
    KB --> GEN[AI Testcase Generator]
    TP --> GEN
    GEN --> RV[Rule-based Validator]
    RV --> HG{Human Audit Gate<br/>VALID / INVALID / INCOMPLETE}
    HG -- INVALID / INCOMPLETE<br/>Review notes --> GEN
    HG -- VALID --> PG[Postman Collection & Test Data Generator]
    PG --> FM[Database Fixture Manager<br/>Setup · Isolation · Restore]
    FD[(Seed Data & Fixture Definitions)] --> FM
    FM --> NE[Newman Execution Engine]
    NE --> RT{Result Triage}
    RT -- Test defect / setup issue --> RV
    RT -- SUT defect --> BUG[Bug Report & GitHub Issue]
    RT -- PASS --> EV[Evidence & Traceability Store]
    BUG --> EV
    EV --> OUT[Excel Summary · HTML/PDF Report · CI/CD]
    OUT -. Coverage gaps and lessons learned .-> TP

